After this, `ucbits = ucbits + FLAC__BITS_PER_WORD - parameter`. Since `parameter > ucbits` (the condition for entering this branch), `ucbits + FLAC__BITS_PER_WORD - parameter < FLAC__BITS_PER_WORD`. So `ucbits` is in the range `[0, FLAC__BITS_PER_WORD-1]`.

